xic herbal medicines for clinical support of chronic kidney disease#🔴 Bulgular (Kırmızı)":[37,39],"#DHerbKB for CKD: knowledge base of diet and toxic herbal medicines for clinical support of chronic kidney disease#🔴 Bulgular (Kırmızı)#{1}":[38,39],"#DHerbKB for CKD: knowledge base of diet and toxic herbal medicines for clinical support of chronic kidney disease#🔵 Sonuç / Conclusions (Mavi)":[40,42],"#DHerbKB for CKD: knowledge base of diet and toxic herbal medicines for clinical support of chronic kidney disease#🔵 Sonuç / Conclusions (Mavi)#{1}":[41,42],"#DHerbKB for CKD: knowledge base of diet and toxic herbal medicines for clinical support of chronic kidney disease#🟠 Limitasyonlar (Turuncu)":[43,44]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Görüntüle","target":"zotero://select/library/items/Q7ADB7DS","line":22},{"title":"Sayfa 1","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/7ZKK4GVB?page=1&annotation=INM2RHUR","line":35},{"title":"Sayfa 5","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/7ZKK4GVB?page=5&annotation=3UAGV47N","line":38},{"title":"Sayfa 1","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/7ZKK4GVB?page=1&annotation=72YXN6RG","line":41}],"metadata":{"Title":"DHerbKB for CKD: knowledge base of diet and toxic herbal medicines for clinical support of chronic kidney disease","Authors":"Huai-Yu Wang, Chi Yuan, Yi-Heng Zhao, Yan Yi, Yi-Nuo Chen, Yelin Li, Dongyuan Chang, Xiaomeng Lin, Ji Wang, Sydney Chi Wai Tang, Qi Wang, Min Chen","Year":2025,"DOI":"10.1186/s12967-025-07178-8","Nitelik":null,"Alan":null,"Konu":null,"AI_Methodology":null,"Layer_Focus":null,"Model_Asamasi":null,"Proposed_Tool":null,"Methods":"To evaluate the DHerbKB, CKD cases with different complications were designed, and full-day dietary schedules covering 136 foods/cuisines were extracted from guidelines/literatures.","Findings":"By integrating multiple guidelines, individualized recommendations were manually extracted and structured on the intake of protein, energy, sodium, potassium, and phosphorus for CKD management","Conclusions":"The DHerbKB integrated and transformed the knowledge and data of CKD dietary management and toxic Chinese herbal medicines control into an easy-to-use and reliable system. Resource covered by the DHerbKB are opened for future researches regarding CKD care, toxic herbs control and related artificial intelligence.","Limitations":"","User_Notes":"böbrek has için çok iyi bir veritabanı olmuş table derste kullanılabilir.  ama ai destekli mi anlamadım, dığrula"},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"last_embed":{"hash":"1k5vq0t","at":1774939742477},"key":"Augmented Dietitian/wangDHerbKBCKDKnowledge2025.md"},
